<section class="section"><div class="container legal"><h2>1. Information we collect</h2><p>We may collect information required to create and maintain your account, provide services, communicate with you and improve SmartCubeMobile.</p><h2>2. How information is used</h2><p>Information should only be used for legitimate, clearly communicated purposes connected with providing the service.</p><h2>3. Financial information</h2><p>Any financial information handled by SmartCubeMobile should be protected using appropriate technical and organisational measures.</p><h2>4. Your rights</h2><p>Depending on your circumstances and applicable law, you may have rights concerning access, correction, deletion and portability of your personal information.</p><h2>5. Contact</h2><p>For privacy enquiries, please use our <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Contact">Contact</a> page.</p></div></section>
